<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}Funding Radar{% endblock %}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{% block description %}Cross-exchange perpetual funding rates and funding arbitrage opportunities across decentralized perp DEXs.{% endblock %}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site_url }}{{ canonical }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ rel }}style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
<nav>
<a href="{{ rel }}index.html">Funding Radar</a>
<a href="{{ rel }}index.html">Arbitrage</a>
<a href="{{ rel }}track-record/">Track Record</a>
<a href="{{ rel }}exchanges/">Exchanges</a>
</nav>
</header>
<main>
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<div class="cta">
<h3>Get funding-arb alerts</h3>
<p>Live cross-exchange funding arbitrage alerts on <a href="{{ telegram_url }}">Telegram</a>,
or query the data programmatically via the <a href="{{ apify_url }}">Apify API</a>.</p>
</div>
<footer>
<p>Funding Radar aggregates funding rates from {{ venue_count }} perpetual DEXs.
Data updates every 30 minutes. Generated {{ generated_human }} UTC.</p>
<p>Not financial advice. Funding arbitrage carries execution, liquidation, and counterparty risk.</p>
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
